The dashboard specifically records 399 Sentinel-2 scenes retrieved and 385 retained after the pixel-count criteria, with the analysis period shown as 2015-12-07 to 2026-06-27. The core imagery is documented as Sentinel-2 L2A and Landsat 8/9 C2 L2.
